# Updating package.json on GitHub

1. Go to `github.com/vadlashiva/dry-powder-paper-trading`
2. Click on `package.json` (at the repo root)
3. Click the pencil (edit) icon, top right of the file view
4. Click inside the code area, press `Ctrl+A` (Windows) or `Cmd+A` (Mac) to select everything
5. Press `Delete`
6. Open the `package.json` file from my last message, copy its entire contents
7. Paste into the now-empty editor on GitHub
8. Scroll down, click **Commit changes**

That updates the `lightweight-charts` version to `^5.0.0` to match the code. Do this along with updating `App.tsx` the same way (select all, delete, paste the latest file, commit) — both files need the update for the fix to work.

Once both are committed, check Vercel's Deployments tab for the new build.
